            <a href="#">我的订单</a>
            <a href="#">帮助中心</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>开启您的中国探索之旅</h1>
        <div class="search-container">
            <div class="input-group">
                <label>目的地</label>
                <input type="text" placeholder="搜索城市、景点或酒店" id="dest">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label>入住日期</label>
                <input type="date" id="checkin">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label>退房日期</label>
                <input type="date" id="checkout">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label>人数</label>
                <select>
                    <option>1 位成人</option>
                    <option selected>2 位成人</option>
                    <option>3 位成人</option>
                    <option>4 位或更多</option>
                </select>
            </div>
            <button class="search-btn" onclick="location.href='results.html'">立即搜索</button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="featured-destinations">
        <h2 class="section-title">热门目的地</h2>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card" onclick="location.href='results.html'">
                <div class="card-img" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1547981609-6776f477307d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80')"></div>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3>北京</h3>
                    <p>探索故宫的雄伟，攀登长城的壮丽，感受古都的深厚文化底蕴。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card" onclick="location.href='results.html'">
                <div class="card-img" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522533367126-35799346944c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80')"></div>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3>上海</h3>
                    <p>在外滩欣赏现代天际线，漫步在武康路的梧桐树下，体验时尚都市生活。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card" onclick="location.href='results.html'">
                <div class="card-img" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529928779617-555773562976?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80')"></div>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3>成都</h3>
                    <p>在太古里感受慢生活，近距离观察憨态可掬的大熊猫，品尝正宗川菜。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card" onclick="location.href='results.html'">
                <div class="card-img" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599571234739-6977a5d0546a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80')"></div>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3>西安</h3>
                    <p>穿越回盛唐时代，参观秦始皇兵马俑，在古城墙上骑行感受历史气息。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <div class="footer-links">
            <a href="#">关于我们</a>
            <a href="#">隐私政策</a>
            <a href="#">用户协议</a>
            <a href="#">联系我们</a>
        </div>
        <p>&copy; 2023 畅行旅行服务有限公司. 保留所有权利。</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
